]\n$ single ruling", "omittedWords": []}], "intertext": ""}], "isSecondLineOfParallelism": false, "isBeginningOfSection": false, "translation": "#tr.en: In battle […] the lair of [@i{Ḫuwawa}.]’"}, {"number": "a+6'", "oldLineNumbers": [], "variants": [{"reconstruction": "%n gilgāmeš | pī[šu | īpušam-ma]", "manuscripts": [{"manuscriptId": 1, "labels": ["r", "i'"], "number": "6'", "atf": "{d}GIŠ K[A-šu i-pu-ša-(am)-ma]\n$ single ruling", "omittedWords": []}], "intertext": ""}], "isSecondLineOfParallelism": false, "isBeginningOfSection": false, "translation": "#tr.en: Gilgameš [opened his mouth,]"}, {"number": "a+7'", "oldLineNumbers": [], "variants": [{"reconstruction": "%n issaq[qaram | ana enkīdu]", "manuscripts": [{"manuscriptId": 1, "labels": ["r", "i'"], "number": "7'", "atf": "is-sa₃-q[ar-am a-na en-ki-du₁₀]", "omittedWords": []}], "intertext": ""}], "isSecondLineOfParallelism": false, "isBeginningOfSection": false, "translation": "#tr.en: saying [to Enkidu:]"}, {"number": "a+8'", "oldLineNumbers": [], "variants": [{"reconstruction": "%n ... [...]", "manuscripts": [{"manuscriptId": 1, "labels": ["r", "i'"], "number": "8'", "atf": "x [...]", "omittedWords": []}], "intertext": ""}], "isSecondLineOfParallelism": false, "isBeginningOfSection": false, "translation": "#tr.en: … […]"}], "record": {"authors": [{"name": "George", "prefix": "Andrew R.", "role": "EDITOR", "orcidNumber": "0000-0001-8231-190X"}, {"name": "Rozzi", "prefix": "Geraldina", "role": "REVISION", "orcidNumber": "0000-0002-1072-2512"}, {"name": "Jiménez", "prefix": "Enrique", "role": "REVISION", "orcidNumber": "0000-0003-0093-528X"}], "translators": [{"name": "George", "prefix": "Andrew R.", "orcidNumber": "0000-0001-8231-190X", "language": "en"}], "publicationDate": "2022-10-13T17:58:21.357308"}, "parserVersion": "6.1.0", "isFilteredQuery": false, "colophonLinesInQuery": {}}